    <Description>In Brawlhalla, the "know spear combo" isn't a widely recognized or common term. However, I assume you might be referring to a specific combo involving the spear weapon in the game.

One of the popular and effective spear combos in Brawlhalla is the "spear string" or "spear combo." To perform a basic spear combo, you can typically follow this sequence of moves:

Nlight (Neutral Light Attack): Start with a neutral light attack by pressing the attack button without holding any directional input. This usually involves your character performing a quick attack with the spear, often a jab or swipe.

Chase Dodge: After the nlight, you can perform a chase dodge by quickly pressing the dodge button in any direction. The chase dodge is a useful mechanic for following up on your initial attack and closing the gap between you and your opponent.

Slight (Side Light Attack): While executing the chase dodge, input a side light attack. This move is typically a horizontal strike with the spear and can lead to a combo if performed correctly.

Additional Attacks: Depending on your opponent's positioning and reaction, you can continue the combo with other attacks. Experiment with additional light attacks, air attacks, or signatures to maximize the damage and extend your combo.

Remember that the effectiveness of a combo can vary depending on the specific legend (character) Best used on pincess nia. Please note that Brawlhalla is an ever-evolving game, and the specific moves and combos may change with updates and balance changes. I recommend checking the most recent patch notes or watching video guides from experienced players to learn about the most effective spear combos in the current version of the game.</Description>
